    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0LB_1LA0RC_1RD0LA_1LD1RC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0LB_1LA0RC_1RD0LA_1LD1RC p j' E).
    + lia.
