    + exact run_ovf_1RB0LB_1LC1RD_0RB0LC_1RA1LD.
    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0LB_1LC1RD_0RB0LC_1RA1LD p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0LB_1LC1RD_0RB0LC_1RA1LD p j' E).
