    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LB_1RC1LD_1LA1RA_0RD1RA [SCycL 3 0; SWin 3; SWinL 4] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
